    keywords: "travel",
    aliases:
        "Supplication for Piety from a Resident to Someone Who is Traveling",
    additionalCategories: [],
    text: "زَوَّدَكَ اللَّهُ التَّقْوَى وَغَفَرَ ذَنْبَكَ  وَيَسَّرَ لَكَ الْخَيْرَ حَيْثُمَا كُنْتَ",
