  DuaEntry.text(
    id: "fitrahive-daily-dua-27",
    category: "forgiveness",
    title:
        "The Best Supplication for Seeking Forgiveness (Sayyid al-Istighfar)",
    keywords: "forgiveness morning evening",
    aliases: "The Best Supplication for Seeking Forgiveness (Sayyid al-Istighfar) Sayyid al-Istighfar The Master of Seeking Forgiveness",
    additionalCategories: ["morning", "evening"],
    text: "اَللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ رَبِّيْ ، لَا إِلٰـهَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ خَلَقْتَنِيْ وَأَنَا عَبْدُكَ ، وَأَنَا عَلَى عَهْدِكَ وَوَعْدِكَ مَا اسْتَطَعْتُ ، أَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ مَا صَنَعْتُ ، أَبُوْءُ لَكَ بِنِعْمتِكَ عَلَيَّ ، وَأَبُوْءُ بِذَنْبِيْ فَاغْفِرْ لِيْ ، فَإِنَّهُ لَا يَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوبَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ",
    meaning: "O Allah, You are my Lord. There is no deity worthy of worship except You. You created me, and I am Your servant. I abide to Your covenant and promise as best I can. I seek refuge in You from the evil of what I have done. I acknowledge Your blessings upon me, and I acknowledge my sin. So forgive me, for none can forgive sins except You.",
    collectionReference: "HR. al-Bukhari No. 6306, 6323, Ahmad IV/122-125, an-Nasa'i VIII/279-280",
    collectionUrl: "https://github.com/fitrahive/dua-dhikr/blob/f42f895f914319a844c3e3c2279483cae060ea19/data/dua-dhikr/daily-dua/en.json",
  ),
  DuaEntry.text(
