    category: "strength",
    title: "For Ease in All Matters",
    keywords: "strength",
    aliases: "Supplication for Ease in All Matters",
    additionalCategories: [],
    text: "اللَّهُمَّ لاَ سَهْلَ إِلاَّ مَا جَعَلْتَهُ سَهْلاً وَأَنْتَ تَجْعَلُ الحَزْنَ إِذَا شِئْتَ سَهْلاً",
    meaning: "O Allah, there is no ease except in that which You make easy, and You make the difficult easy if You wish.",
