    category: "strength",
    title: "When Afflicted by Calamity",
    keywords: "strength",
    aliases: "Supplication When Afflicted by Calamity",
    additionalCategories: [],
    text: "إِنَّا لِلَّهِ وَإِنَّا إِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُونَ اللَّهُمَّ أْجُرْنِى فِى مُصِيبَتِى وَأَخْلِفْ لِى خَيْرًا مِنْهَا",
    meaning: "Indeed we belong to Allah, and indeed to Him we will return. O Allah, reward me for my affliction and replace it with something better.",
    collectionReference: "HR. Muslim",
    collectionUrl: "https://github.com/fitrahive/dua-dhikr/blob/f42f895f914319a844c3e3c2279483cae060ea19/data/dua-dhikr/daily-dua/en.json",
  ),
  DuaEntry.text(
